- PySOEM: https://github.com/bnjmnp/pysoem (MIT)
- SOEM: https://github.com/OpenEtherCATsociety/SOEM (GPLv3 / Commercial)

Users of this software are responsible for ensuring their use of SOEM
(via PySOEM) complies with the applicable SOEM license terms. For
